{"type":"text","timestamp":1785043848262,"sessionID":"ses_0631a3b64ffeDjTYnR0NUdqFWg","part":{"id":"prt_f9ce75183001fOTGgjigcj4dRD","messageID":"msg_f9ce72d1e001KKKQIPL50yj8yN","sessionID":"ses_0631a3b64ffeDjTYnR0NUdqFWg","type":"text","text":"查询完成。以下是结果汇总：\n\n---\n\n## 结果分析\n\n### 1. 女性客户中最低平均薪资（A11）\n- **最低 A11 = 8110**（district 67）\n- 对应的女性客户有 20 位，她们的 account_id 分别为：3214, 2679, 694, 2685, 526, 3844, 1387, 1097, 3690, 1518, 1249, 4195, 6158, 1516, 11362, 2436, 2176, 2049, 204, 4858\n\n### 2. 最低薪资女性客户中最年长的\n- **最年长的是 client_id = 3888**，出生日期 **1916-10-27**\n- 对应的 **account_id = 3214**\n- （出生年份越早 = 年龄越大）\n\n### 3. 薪资差距\n- 最高 A11 = 12541，最低 A11 = 8110\n- **Gap = 12541 - 8110 = 4431**\n\n---\n\n**Final Answer:**\n- 女性客户中最低平均薪资为 8110（district 67），共 20 位女性客户，她们的 account_id 为：204, 526, 694, 1097, 1249, 1387, 1516, 1518, 2049, 2176, 2436, 2679, 2685, 3214, 3690, 3844, 4195, 4858, 6158, 11362。\n- 其中最年长的是 **account_id = 3214**（client_id = 3888，出生日期 1916-10-27）。\n- 最高与最低平均薪资的差距（Gap）为 **4431**。\n\n**Evidence SQL:**\n```sql\nSELECT a.account_id, c.client_id, c.birth_date, d.A11,\n       (SELECT MAX(d3.A11) FROM client c3 JOIN district d3 ON c3.district_id = d3.district_id WHERE c3.gender = 'F') \n       - (SELECT MIN(d2.A11) FROM client c2 JOIN district d2 ON c2.district_id = d2.district_id WHERE c2.gender = 'F') AS gap\nFROM client c\nJOIN district d ON c.district_id = d.district_id\nJOIN disp dp ON c.client_id = dp.client_id\nJOIN account a ON dp.account_id = a.account_id\nWHERE c.gender = 'F'\n  AND d.A11 = (SELECT MIN(d2.A11) FROM client c2 JOIN district d2 ON c2.district_id = d2.district_id WHERE c2.gender = 'F')\nORDER BY c.birth_date ASC\nLIMIT 1\n```","time":{"start":1785043833219,"end":1785043848255}}}
